Dear all,

We would be very interested to know more about the design of the targeted exome project you are testing on CODEX.
Actually we try with some difficulties to make the CODEX package run on a targeted exome whose BED file encompass 30 genes on 16 chromosomes. Our targets include the exonic and the intronic sequences of these genes.

My question would be : is CODEX as efficient as before with so few targets ? Which one is your design ?

I join you the BED file of our experiment.

Thank you a lot in advance for your help and advices !

Kindly yours,

Yvan
